<title>SPAIN: B/Spain leaves key rate unchanged at 5.25 percent.</title>
<headline>B/Spain leaves key rate unchanged at 5.25 percent.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain said on Tuesday it left its key money rate unchanged at 5.25 percent at its regular repurchase tender for central bank certificates.</p>
<p>It allotted 3.00 trillion pesetas ($20 billion) against 3.48 trillion pesetas bid.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34  1585 2167 ($ = 150.3 Spanish Pesetas)</p>
